{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A facility run by a mysterious director conducting research into quantifying fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The user will be a test subject there, undergoing terrifying experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a simple game in which the player must simply endure the terror of cockroaches without being scared.<br><br>Features<br>1.Single-player experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.Explore the laboratory to locate the giant cockroach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3.Encounter cockroaches of various sizes throughout your journey. Endure the terror as they creep toward you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4.Complete the game by defeating the giant cockroach and escaping from the laboratory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5.Gameplay duration: Approximately 15-30 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3616840?t=1750408721","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3616840?t=1750408721","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616840/465118dd6e61c239c06ee9546bcb9e3d678e0ea6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750408721","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616840/465118dd6e61c239c06ee9546bcb9e3d678e0ea6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750408721","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"fear, insect"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A facility run by a mysterious director conducting research into quantifying fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The user will be a test subject there, undergoing terrifying experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a simple game in which the player must simply endure the terror of cockroaches without being scared.<br><br>Features<br>